>Augusta Labs</span></span></p>", :font-family "font-ff0051ea-2479-4922-b67e-04ab2bbea9c3"}, #uuid "c4873f2f-9f5b-4e43-849e-477598234e6e" {:fill-color {:r 229, :g 231, :b 240, :a 1}, :entity-type :block, :shape-type :rectangle, :white-space :break-spaces, :coords {:x-start 0.021010018407882636, :x-end 0.9784172059078828, :y-start 0.9416943107132394, :y-end 0.9435461625650912}, :events [], :border? true, :even-padding? true, :border-width 0, :block-type :shape, :border-color {:r 229, :g 231, :b 240, :a 1}, :body "<p></p>", :arrowhead-type :triangle}, #uuid "a19f7453-8986-4340-82dd-4bd90befd3b4" {:entity-type :block, :text-align :right, :white-space :break-spaces, :font-size 0.45, :font-weight 400, :auto-resize? false, :auto-align-default :left, :coords {:x-start 0.9578581407800184, :y-start 0.951965238121355, :x-end 0.9786336077143513, :y-end 0.9769652214200049}, :events [], :text-color {:r 147, :g 157, :b 168, :a 1}, :auto-vertical-align-default :top, :text-type :paragraph, :used-fonts #{#uuid "ff0051ea-2479-4922-b67e-04ab2bbea9c3"}, :block-type :text, :body "<p><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="text-decoration:none">17</span></span></p>", :font-family "font-ff0051ea-2479-4922-b67e-04ab2bbea9c3"}, #uuid "d75946b7-3b32-4a16-9075-8674a5a1cf3f" {:entity-type :block, :table-data [["<p>P&amp;L element</p>" "<p>Pain-points</p>" "<p>High-ROI AI levers</p>"] ["<p>Revenue</p>" "<p>Underutilised clinical capacity with persistent idle time.</p>" "<p>🟢 <span style="font-weight:700">AI Scheduling Optimizer</span> | Fills cancellations, balances load, and improves room and clinician use.</p>"] ["<p></p>" "<p>Patient funnel leakage from weak conversion and slow responses.</p>" "<p>🟢 <span style="font-weight:700">AI Conversion and Intake Agent | </span>Engages leads, answers FAQs, and books appointments automatically.</p>"] ["<p></p>" "<p>Low revenue per visit from missed cross sell and underused care.</p>" "<p><span style="font-weight:700">🔵 AI Visit Value Recommender | </span>Suggests add ons, diagnostics, and follow ups at booking.</p>"] ["<p></p>" "<p>Inconsistent service yield from weak pricing discipline.</p>" "<p><span style="font-weight:700">🔵 Smart Pricing and Yield Controls | </span>Monitors yield, detects pricing drift, and flags issues.</p>"] ["<p>COGS</p>" "<p>Revenue loss from coding and charge capture errors.</p>" "<p><span style="font-weight:700">🔵 Automated Charge and Billing Checker | </span>Reconciles treatments, diagnostics, and charges in real time. </p>"] ["<p></p>" "<p>Excess clinician time spent on admin and documentation.</p>" "<p>🟢 <span style="font-weight:700">Clinical Documentation Assistant | </span>Drafts notes, documentation, and care summaries automatically.</p>"] ["<p></p>" "<p>Workflow variability causing uneven outcomes and waste.</p>" "<p><span style="font-weight:700">🔵 Care Pathway Standardiser | </span>Recommends best practice protocols and aligns material and time utilisation.</p>"] ["<p></p>" "<p>Procurement fragmented with limited scale benefits.</p>" "<p>🟢 <span style="font-weight:700">Automated Supplier Bidding Tool | </span>Runs sourcing events and finds consolidation opportunities.</p>"] ["<p></p>" "<p>Lack of SKU visibility for consumables, devices, and meds.</p>" "<p>🟢 <span style="font-weight:700">AI Demand Forecaster | </span>Consolidates network level demand for materials and schedules replenishment.</p>"] ["<p>SG&amp;A</p>" "<p>Contact centres and front desks burdened by repetitive tasks.</p>" "<p>🟢 <span style="font-weight:700">Call and Contact Automation Agent | </span>Automates confirmations, reminders, follow ups, and queries.</p>"] ["<p></p>" "<p>Duplicated administrative work across clinics and central teams.</p>" "<p><span style="font-weight:700">🔵 Document Workflow Bot | </span>Auto populates, routes, and tracks internal forms, referrals, and authorisations.</p>"] ["<p></p>" "<p>Manual billing and collections causing long cycles and rework.</p>" "<p>🟢 <span style="font-weight:700">Billing and Collections Assistant | </span>Automates invoices, reminders, and delinquency follow up.</p>"] ["<p>Working Capital</p>" "<p>Overstocking, expiry, and stock outs from poor demand visibility.</p>" "<p>🟢 <span style="font-weight:700">Smart Replenishment System</span> | Reorders automatically based on live consumption and velocity.</p>"] ["<p></p>" "<p>Shrinkage and waste driven by fragmented or manual monitoring.</p>" "<p>🟢 <span style="font-weight:700">Inventory Control Dashboard</span> | Tracks usage, expiry, and anomalies across clinics to reduce waste.</p>"]], :font-size 0.45, :layout {:cols [0.09298322834258269 0.32571754126810637 0.5345545639094681], :rows [0.04277264227910077 0.04074073118376186 0.04074077769150957 0.04074073118376186 0.04074073118376186 0.04074073118376186 0.04074077769150957 0.040740687776530664 0.040740687776530664 0.04074077769150957 0.04074077769150957 0.040740687776530664 0.04074077769150957 0.040740687776530664 0.040740740740740744]}, :coords {:y-start 0.237462507492651, :x-start 0.019991317486355083, :x-end 0.9774049593267891, :y-end 0.8822686352466977}, :events [], :used-fonts #{#uuid "ff0051ea-2479-4922-b67e-04ab2bbea9c3"}, :block-type :table, :border-color {:r 43, :g 42, :b 53, :a 0}, :table-style {[13 2] {:text-color {:r 147, :g 157, :b 168, :a 1}, :background-color {:r 249, :g 249, :b 249, :a 1}, :font-size 0.5}, [0 1] {:font-weight 700, :background-color {:r 43, :g 42, :b 53, :a 1}, :text-color {:r 255, :g 255, :b 255, :a 1}, :font-size 0.55}, [14 0] {:font-weight 700, :background-color {:r 249, :g 249, :b 249, :a 1}, :font-size 0.5}, [9 1] {:text-color {:r 147, :g 157, :b 168, :a 1}, :background-color {:r 249, :g 249, :b 249, :a 1}, :font-size 0.5}, [1 2] {:text-color {:r 147, :g 157, :b 168, :a 1}, :background-color {:r 255, :g 255, :b 255, :a 1}, :font-weight 400, :font-size 0.5}, [0 0] {:font-weight 700, :background-color {:r 43, :g 42, :b 53, :a 1}, :text-color {:r 255, :g 255, :b 255, :a 1}, :font-size 0.55